# Op2_TestAttackBoxAtDrawn: the attack pause running (ruling 5, 2), at its first call: $1(a4) = 15,
# as Boss_Hatter_RoadHazardHit ($03DE62) leaves it after the road hazard (Scr2_03DE22, one of
# the op's two users) hits a player, so the op counts it down and skips the test. A real state
# (fuzz-113400-s2 runs that hit callback), but on the Hatter road an H-int lands in every call
# and verify skips them (docs/NOTES.md "verify can hardly check the Hatter road").

case paused
b a4 + 1 = $F
